# 27. INTERPRETATION

This License shall be interpreted to preserve the freedom to:

1. use the Covered Work;
2. study the Covered Work;
3. modify the Covered Work;
4. redistribute the Covered Work;
5. access Corresponding Source; and
6. operate modified versions.

Where a provision is ambiguous, it should, to the maximum extent legally permissible, be interpreted consistently with these freedoms.

Nothing in this License creates rights beyond those permitted by applicable law.

