# 32. GOVERNING PRINCIPLE

This License establishes the following fundamental rule:

> **If the freedom enters the network through a Covered Work, the freedom must remain available throughout every Covered implementation to which the copyleft obligations of this License legally attach.**

No architecture, deployment model, hosting arrangement, API boundary, container boundary, virtualization layer, cloud provider, distributed-worker arrangement, or Node/Block separation shall by itself be treated as an automatic exception to the copyleft requirements of this License.

